{"updated_at": {"date": {"d": "26", "m": "10", "Y": "2026"}, "time": {"H": "02", "M": "07", "S": "13"}}, "news": [{"title": "Upkeep agency blocks deliveries, house helps at Ajnara Homes in Greater Noida West over dues", "para": "Residents of Ajnara Homes recently decided to withhold maintenance fees for four months due to ongoing issues related to poor upkeep and unresolved complaints. In response, the builder's maintenance agency imposed restrictions on food deliveries and domestic help services, creating considerable hardship for residents who found themselves having to fetch groceries from the main gate.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/residential/upkeep-agency-blocks-deliveries-house-helps-at-ajnara-homes-in-greater-noida-west-over-dues/135200460?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-236908/135200460.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "residential"}, {"title": "Karnataka-RERA orders Eco Life Developers to hand over project documents & funds", "para": "The Karnataka Real Estate Regulatory Authority has mandated Eco Life Developers to establish a formal association of allottees, with a strict deadline of 60 days. This action follows a complaint from buyer Swetha Rangaswamy, who accused the developers of not meeting essential statutory requirements, including failing to demonstrate proof of the association's registration. The authority underscores the importance of addressing these obligations promptly.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/rera/karnataka-rera-orders-eco-life-developers-to-hand-over-project-documents-funds/135200444?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-52250/135200444.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "rera"}, {"title": "USA: Home sellers are lowering their price and helping buyers to make a deal in a stagnant market", "para": "Homeowners nationwide are facing challenges in selling their properties amid a stagnant housing market and escalating mortgage rates. Many are finding themselves forced to reduce their prices and offer incentives just to attract buyers. This evolving market landscape is impacting vital life choices, including job relocations or downsizing. Consequently, a large volume of homes is left unsold for lengthy periods, intensifying the imbalance as sellers significantly outnumber potential buyers.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/international/usa-home-sellers-are-lowering-their-price-and-helping-buyers-to-make-a-deal-in-a-stagnant-market/135200395?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-45558/135200395.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "international"}]}